    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大星妈妈想关了TikTok，但是现在TikTok上是北京。大星妈妈非常喜欢北京，她想再看看。",
      "traditional": "大星媽媽想關了TikTok，但是現在TikTok上是北京。大星媽媽非常喜歡北京，她想再看看。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng mā ma xiǎng guān le 1 dàn shì xiàn zài 1 shang shì běi jīng dà xīng mā ma fēi cháng xǐ huan běi jīng tā xiǎng zài kàn kan",
      "english": "Daxing’s mom wanted to close TikTok, but TikTok was now showing Beijing. Daxing’s mom really likes Beijing. She wanted to watch more."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "现在TikTok上是漂亮的衣服。大星的妈妈很喜欢漂亮的衣服，她想再看看。",
      "traditional": "現在TikTok上是漂亮的衣服。大星的媽媽很喜歡漂亮的衣服，她想再看看。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài 1 shang shì piào liang de yī fu dà xīng de mā ma hěn xǐ huan piào liang de yī fu tā xiǎng zài kàn kan",
      "english": "TikTok was now showing pretty clothes. Daxing’s mom really likes pretty clothes. She wanted to watch more."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "现在TikTok上是小朋友。大星妈妈非常非常喜欢小朋友，她想再看看。",
      "traditional": "現在TikTok上是小朋友。大星媽媽非常非常喜歡小朋友，她想再看看。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài 1 shang shì xiǎo péng you dà xīng mā ma fēi cháng fēi cháng xǐ huan xiǎo péng you tā xiǎng zài kàn kan",
      "english": "TikTok was now showing children. Daxing’s mom really, really likes children. She wanted to watch more."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "现在TikTok上是小猫，大星妈妈太喜欢小猫了，她想再看看。",
      "traditional": "現在TikTok上是小貓，大星媽媽太喜歡小貓了，她想再看看。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài 1 shang shì xiǎo māo dà xīng mā ma tài xǐ huan xiǎo māo le tā xiǎng zài kàn kan",
      "english": "TikTok was showing kittens. Daxing’s mom really likes kittens. She wanted to watch more."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "大星的妈妈不工作了，她和苹果看TikTok，他们看了一个小时。",
      "traditional": "大星的媽媽不工作了，她和蘋果看TikTok，他們看了一個小時。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng de mā ma bù gōng zuò le tā hé píng guǒ kàn 1 tā men kàn le yí ge xiǎo shí",
      "english": "Daxing’s mom didn’t work anymore. She and Apple watched TikTok. They watched it for an hour."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "苹果看看我，我知道他的意思。他的意思是：你看，我知道主人喜欢什么，她听我的。真好玩！",
      "traditional": "蘋果看看我，我知道他的意思。他的意思是：你看，我知道主人喜歡什麼，她聽我的。真好玩！",
      "pinyin": "píng guǒ kàn kan wǒ wǒ zhī dào tā de yì si tā de yì si shì nǐ kàn wǒ zhī dào zhǔ rén xǐ huan shén me tā tīng wǒ de zhēn hǎo wán",
      "english": "Apple looked at me. I knew what he meant. He meant: You see, I know what my owner likes. She listens to me. It’s really fun!"
    }
  ],
