    "sentence_translations": [
      "(6) It’s Really Fun",
      "",
      "Daxing’s mom wanted to close TikTok, but TikTok was now showing Beijing. Daxing’s mom really likes Beijing. She wanted to watch more.",
      "",
      "TikTok was now showing pretty clothes. Daxing’s mom really likes pretty clothes. She wanted to watch more.",
      "",
      "TikTok was now showing children. Daxing’s mom really, really likes children. She wanted to watch more.",
      "",
